  "statement_html": "<div class=\"float_right\"><span class=\"pax-fig-group\"> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 300\"><polygon points=\"88.24,70.59 17.65,247.06 264.71,247.06\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0000ff\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><polygon points=\"52.94,158.82 176.47,158.82 194.12,217.65 70.59,217.65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"17.65\" y1=\"247.06\" x2=\"176.47\" y2=\"158.82\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"264.71\" y1=\"247.06\" x2=\"52.94\" y2=\"158.82\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><text x=\"88.24\" y=\"60.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">A</text><text x=\"264.71\" y=\"255.88\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">C</text><text x=\"17.65\" y=\"255.88\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">B</text><text x=\"35.29\" y=\"141.18\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">C'</text><text x=\"183.53\" y=\"141.18\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">B'</text><text x=\"61.76\" y=\"202.94\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">I</text><text x=\"194.12\" y=\"202.94\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">J</text><text x=\"123.53\" y=\"167.65\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">G</text></svg></span></div>\t   Soit un triangle \\(A B C\\), \\(B'\\) le milieu de \\(\\left[ A C\\right]\\), \\(C'\\) le milieu de \\(\\left[ A B\\right]\\).\t   On note \\(G\\) le point commun des droites \\((B B')\\) et \\((C C')\\).\t   On note \\(I\\) le milieu de \\(\\left[ B G\\right]\\) et \\(J\\) celui de \\(\\left[ C G\\right]\\).<p>\t   Il faut démontrer que les médianes d'un triangle se coupent aux deux tiers de leur longueur en partant d'un sommet.\t</p><p>\t   Pour cela, vous devez compléter le raisonnement suivant:\t</p>\t<br class=\"clearall\">\t<ul><li>\t   On sait par le  <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply1\" data-label=\"thm1\"></span> dans le triangle  <cf-slot name=\"reply2\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot> que:\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">  <cf-slot name=\"reply3\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot>= <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"3\"></span> <cf-slot name=\"reply5\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot>.</div>\t</li><li>\t   On sait par le  <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply6\" data-label=\"thm2\"></span> dans le triangle  <cf-slot name=\"reply7\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot> que:\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">  <cf-slot name=\"reply8\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot>= <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply9\" data-size=\"3\"></span> <cf-slot name=\"reply10\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot>.</div>\t</li><li>On en déduit l'égalité :  <cf-slot name=\"reply11\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot>= <cf-slot name=\"reply12\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot>.\t</li><li>\t   Donc le quadrilatère \\(C'B'J I\\) est un  <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply13\" data-label=\"quadrilatère\"></span>.\t</li><li>\t   Il vient \\(C'G\\)= <cf-slot name=\"reply14\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot> et \\(B'G\\)= <cf-slot name=\"reply15\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot>.\t</li><li>\t   Ainsi, étant données les définitions de \\(I\\) et \\(J\\), on a :\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\t\\(J C = J G\\)= <cf-slot name=\"reply16\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot> et \\(I B = I G\\)= <cf-slot name=\"reply17\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"80\"></cf-slot>.\t</div>\t</li></ul>\t",
